#: ../../../components/initialization.md:1
msgid "Initializer"
msgstr "Initializer"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:3
msgid ""
"Before starting a run, `Optimizer` delegates constructing the initial "
"`Population`/`Archive`/`ParetoArchive` and the first `OptimizationState` "
"all at once to `Initializer`, a swappable component. To change the "
"sampling method, you only need to swap out this `Initializer`, not "
"`Optimizer` itself."
msgstr "`Optimizer`は実行を始める前に、初期`Population`/`Archive`/`ParetoArchive`と最初の`OptimizationState`を一括で構築する処理を、`Initializer`という差し替え可能なコンポーネントに委ねています。 サンプリング方法を変えたいときは、`Optimizer`本体ではなくこの`Initializer`だけを差し替えればよいです。"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:6
msgid "Initializer's role"
msgstr "Initializerの役割"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:8
msgid ""
"`Initializer` requires only one method, `initialize(provider, problem) ->"
" OptimizationState`, to be implemented. `provider` is a "
"`ComponentProvider` for accessing other already-constructed components "
"such as `Algorithm`/`Evaluator`, and `problem` is the "
"[Problem](problem.md) to solve."
msgstr "`Initializer`が実装を要求するメソッドは`initialize(provider, problem) -> OptimizationState`の1つだけです。 `provider`は`Algorithm`/`Evaluator`など構築済みの他コンポーネントへアクセスするための`ComponentProvider`、`problem`は解くべき[Problem](problem.md)です。"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:11
msgid "Built-in Initializers"
msgstr "組み込みInitializer"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md
msgid "Class"
msgstr "クラス"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md
msgid "Sampling method"
msgstr "サンプリング方法"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md
msgid "`LHSInitializer`"
msgstr "`LHSInitializer`"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md
msgid "`scipy.stats.qmc.LatinHypercube`"
msgstr "`scipy.stats.qmc.LatinHypercube`"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md
msgid "`RandomInitializer`"
msgstr "`RandomInitializer`"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md
msgid "`rng.uniform`"
msgstr "`rng.uniform`"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md
msgid "`SobolInitializer`"
msgstr "`SobolInitializer`"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md
msgid "`scipy.stats.qmc.Sobol(scramble=True)`"
msgstr "`scipy.stats.qmc.Sobol(scramble=True)`"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:19
msgid ""
"All three classes share the same constructor, `(n_init_archive, "
"n_init_population, seed=None)`. They also share the same flow: sample "
"`n_init_archive` points and evaluate them, then feed the top "
"`n_init_population` (sorted by `comparator`) into the initial "
"`Population`."
msgstr "3クラスとも、コンストラクタは`(n_init_archive, n_init_population, seed=None)`で共通しています。 `n_init_archive`件をサンプリングして評価し、その中から`comparator`でソートした上位`n_init_population`件を初期`Population`へ投入する、という流れも共通です。"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:30
msgid ""
"The three classes' implementations are nearly identical except for the "
"one line doing the sampling — this is a deliberate choice for simplicity,"
" a design that doesn't over-abstract the shared processing."
msgstr "3クラスの実装はサンプリング方法の1行以外ほぼ重複していますが、これは意図的な単純さの選択であり、共通処理を過度に抽象化しない設計になっています。"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:32
msgid "Base-class helper methods"
msgstr "基底クラスのヘルパーメソッド"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:34
msgid ""
"The `Initializer` base provides two helper methods reusable in custom "
"implementations."
msgstr "`Initializer`基底には、独自実装で再利用できる2つのヘルパーメソッドが用意されています。"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:36
msgid ""
"**`_create_attrs(problem, provider)`**: Assembles the list of "
"`PopulationAttribute`s for `Population`/`Archive`. Adds algorithm-"
"specific attributes (such as PSO's velocity) returned by "
"`provider.algorithm.get_required_attrs(problem)` on top of the standard "
"attributes `x`/`f`/`g`/`cv`."
msgstr "**`_create_attrs(problem, provider)`**：`Population`/`Archive`用の`PopulationAttribute`一覧を組み立てます。 `x`/`f`/`g`/`cv`という標準属性に、`provider.algorithm.get_required_attrs(problem)`が返すアルゴリズム固有の属性（PSOの速度など）を追加します。"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:39
msgid ""
"**`_create_context(problem, archive, pareto_archive, population, rng)`**:"
" Constructs `OptimizationState`. If `comparator` is an `NSGA3Comparator` "
"and doesn't yet have an internal rng, this is where `rng.spawn(1)[0]` is "
"injected."
msgstr "**`_create_context(problem, archive, pareto_archive, population, rng)`**：`OptimizationState`を構築します。 `comparator`が`NSGA3Comparator`で、まだ内部rngを持たない場合はここで`rng.spawn(1)[0]`を注入します。"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:42
msgid "Implementing a custom Initializer"
msgstr "独自Initializerの実装方法"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:44
msgid ""
"If you need a custom sampling method, subclass `Initializer` and "
"implement `initialize()`. The three built-in classes' implementations "
"serve directly as a template; the responsibility they carry internally "
"can be organized into the following 9 steps."
msgstr "独自のサンプリング方法が必要な場合は、`Initializer`を継承して`initialize()`を実装します。 組み込み3クラスの実装がそのままテンプレートになり、内部で担う責務は次の9ステップに整理できます。"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:47
msgid ""
"Construct `Population`/`Archive`/`ParetoArchive` via "
"`provider.algorithm.population_class`/`archive_class`/`create_pareto_archive`"
msgstr "`provider.algorithm.population_class`/`archive_class`/`create_pareto_archive`で`Population`/`Archive`/`ParetoArchive`を構築します"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:48
msgid "Construct `OptimizationState` via `_create_context`"
msgstr "`_create_context`で`OptimizationState`を構築します"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:49
msgid "Sample from the design-variable space"
msgstr "設計変数空間からサンプリングします"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:50
msgid "Fire `provider.dispatch(InitialEvaluationStartEvent(...))`"
msgstr "`provider.dispatch(InitialEvaluationStartEvent(...))`を発火します"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:51
msgid "Evaluate via `provider.evaluator.evaluate_batch(x, problem)`"
msgstr "`provider.evaluator.evaluate_batch(x, problem)`で評価します"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:52
msgid "`add` the results to `archive`/`pareto_archive`"
msgstr "結果を`archive`/`pareto_archive`へ`add`します"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:53
msgid "Add to the evaluation count via `ctx.count_fe(...)`"
msgstr "`ctx.count_fe(...)`で評価回数を加算します"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:54
msgid "Fire `provider.dispatch(InitialEvaluationEndEvent(...))`"
msgstr "`provider.dispatch(InitialEvaluationEndEvent(...))`を発火します"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:55
msgid ""
"Sort via `problem.comparator.sort_population` and feed the top entries "
"into `population`"
msgstr "`problem.comparator.sort_population`でソートし、上位件数を`population`へ投入します"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:57
msgid ""
"The following example is an `Initializer` that generates initial samples "
"with `scipy.stats.qmc.Halton`."
msgstr "次の例は、`scipy.stats.qmc.Halton`で初期サンプルを生成する`Initializer`です。"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:117
msgid ""
"`InitialEvaluationStartEvent`/`InitialEvaluationEndEvent` are events "
"observable via [CallbackManager](callbacks.md). See "
"[Evaluator](evaluation.md) for the details of evaluation itself."
msgstr "`InitialEvaluationStartEvent`/`InitialEvaluationEndEvent`は[CallbackManager](callbacks.md)経由で観察できるイベントです。 評価そのものの詳細は[Evaluator](evaluation.md)を参照してください。"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:120
msgid "Swap it via `Optimizer.set_initializer(initializer)`."
msgstr "`Optimizer.set_initializer(initializer)`で差し替えます。"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:122
msgid "Related components"
msgstr "関連コンポーネント"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:124
msgid ""
"[OptimizationState](optimization_state.md): The state object "
"`initialize()` ultimately returns"
msgstr "[OptimizationState](optimization_state.md)：`initialize()`が最終的に返す状態オブジェクト"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:125
msgid ""
"[Population](population.md): The `Population`/`Archive`/`ParetoArchive` "
"being constructed"
msgstr "[Population](population.md)：構築対象の`Population`/`Archive`/`ParetoArchive`"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:126
msgid "[Evaluator](evaluation.md): Used to evaluate the initial samples"
msgstr "[Evaluator](evaluation.md)：初期サンプルの評価に使う"

#: ../../../components/initialization.md:127
msgid ""
"[CallbackManager](callbacks.md): Observing "
"`InitialEvaluationStartEvent`/`InitialEvaluationEndEvent`"
msgstr "[CallbackManager](callbacks.md)：`InitialEvaluationStartEvent`/`InitialEvaluationEndEvent`の観察"

